      "text": "Chapter 6. My Weekend (나의 주말) - Sunday Afternoon (일요일 오후)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "On some Sunday afternoons, my friends and I take turns visiting one another's homes, where we either go out for a meal together or simply sit and talk for hours.",
          "chunks": [
            {
              "en": "On some Sunday afternoons,",
              "ko": "어떤 일요일 오후에는,"
            },
            {
              "en": "my friends and I take turns visiting one another's homes,",
              "ko": "친구들과 저는 돌아가며 서로의 집을 방문하는데,"
            },
            {
              "en": "where we either go out for a meal together",
              "ko": "함께 나가서 식사를 하거나"
            },
            {
              "en": "or simply sit and talk for hours.",
              "ko": "그냥 앉아서 몇 시간이고 이야기를 나눕니다."
            }
          ],
          "words": [
            {
              "word": "go out for",
              "say": "go out for",
              "meaning": "~하러 나가다",
              "pos": "구동사",
              "start": 101,
              "end": 111,
              "choices": [
                "catching up",
                "give back",
                "light up"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "These visits have been taking place for nearly a decade, and they have seen us through job changes, house moves, and several family milestones.",
          "chunks": [
            {
              "en": "These visits have been taking place for nearly a decade,",
              "ko": "이런 만남은 거의 10년째 이어져 오고 있는데,"
            },
            {
              "en": "and they have seen us through job changes,",
              "ko": "덕분에 우리는 이직과"
            },
            {
              "en": "house moves, and several family milestones.",
              "ko": "이사, 여러 가족 대소사를 함께 겪어 왔습니다."
            }
          ],
          "words": [
            {
              "word": "milestone",
              "say": "milestone",
              "meaning": "중요한 일, 대소사",
              "pos": "명사",
              "start": 132,
              "end": 142,
              "choices": [
                "materials",
                "hymns",
                "census"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "When we are not with friends, we usually spend the afternoon at either my parents' home or my in-laws', catching up over a home-cooked meal.",
          "chunks": [
            {
              "en": "When we are not with friends,",
              "ko": "친구들과 만나지 않는 날에는,"
            },
            {
              "en": "we usually spend the afternoon",
              "ko": "보통 오후를 보내는데"
            },
            {
              "en": "at either my parents' home or my in-laws',",
              "ko": "우리 부모님 댁이나 배우자의 부모님 댁에서,"
            },
            {
              "en": "catching up over a home-cooked meal.",
              "ko": "집밥을 먹으며 그간의 소식을 나눕니다."
            }
          ],
          "words": [
            {
              "word": "catch up",
              "say": "catch up",
              "meaning": "(소식을) 나누다",
              "pos": "구동사",
              "start": 104,
              "end": 115,
              "choices": [
                "give back",
                "light up",
                "stock up on"
              ]
            },
            {
              "word": "home-cooked",
