            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Although these visits sometimes feel like an obligation after a long week, I have come to see them as a way to give back to the parents who dedicated so much of their lives to us.",
          "chunks": [
            {
              "en": "Although these visits sometimes feel like an obligation",
              "ko": "이런 방문이 가끔은 의무처럼 느껴지기도 하지만"
            },
            {
              "en": "after a long week,",
              "ko": "고된 한 주를 보낸 뒤에는,"
            },
            {
              "en": "I have come to see them as a way to give back",
              "ko": "저는 이것을 보답하는 방법으로 여기게 되었습니다"
            },
            {
              "en": "to the parents who dedicated so much of their lives to us.",
              "ko": "인생의 많은 부분을 우리에게 바쳐 주신 부모님께."
            }
          ],
