        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Watching our parents' faces light up when we arrive reminds me that the strong work ethic I bring to my job should never come at the expense of family.",
          "chunks": [
            {
              "en": "Watching our parents' faces light up when we arrive",
              "ko": "우리가 도착할 때 부모님의 얼굴이 환해지는 것을 보면"
            },
            {
